      "zh": "Nintendo Switch 是任天堂 2017 年发布的融合型游戏机，主机掌机二合一，以平板主体、底座 Dock 与可拆 Joy-Con 手柄实现形态自由切换，是游戏机厅「融合路线破亿」叙事线的核心展品。",
      "en": "The Nintendo Switch, released in 2017, is a hybrid console combining home and handheld play through its tablet, Dock, and detachable Joy-Con controllers."
